<title>SWITZERLAND: Novartis expects to post flat 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Novartis expects to post flat 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novartis AG said that, excluding one-off merger-related exceptional income and expenses, it expects net income for 1996 as a whole to be approximately at the same level as the previous year.</p>
<p>Novartis was formed by the merger of Ciba-Geigy AG and Sandoz AG. Their combined net income for 1995 was 4.2 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>The company said that it will publish its financial statements for 1996 on March 18.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
